d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉禾百咏 其七十二 惠明堂","author":"张尧同","text":"地僻无人到，松风鹤梦清。\n一灯禅榻畔，自向暗中明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50791,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉禾百咏 其六十九 普济院","author":"张尧同","text":"祗应曾布地，往往化为鱼。\n一遇丁千骑，禅人便结庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50792,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉禾百咏 其五十七 景龙楼","author":"张尧同","text":"千秋传异綵，百尺护雕阑。\n欲识金龙瑞，丹霄试仰看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50793,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉禾百咏 其六十二 景德禅院","author":"张尧同","text":"白毫光未灭，胜事百年中。\n好是传灯地，林泉有古风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50794,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉禾百咏 其七十六 福顺庙","author":"张尧同","text":"老屋无丹雘，空阶只翠苔。\n绕檐看箭镞，谁记赤眉来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50795,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉禾百咏 其八十五 简斋","author":"张尧同","text":"诗老追唐句，閒居筑简斋。\n芙蓉寒浦外，红落感秋怀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50796,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]